    "SkillPrioNotes": "Skill 1 is a nice chunk of Burst Damage when entering Full Burst, and a damage taken debuff to add up with S2. Can be leveled up more if you plan on using her in campaign.\r\n\r\nSkill 2 is where the bulk of her personal DPS comes from against bosses, regardless of the team composition she’s used in. While the damage taken debuff on S1 is higher compared to S2’s, both scale poorly with skill levels anyway, so damage is the biggest reason to go for more S2 levels.\r\n\r\nBurst provides allies with a very nice caster ATK buff, one of the biggest for a 20s CD unit. It’s honestly such a shame Brid can’t benefit from her own buff, though.",
